public static boolean isDiverse(int[][] arr2D) {
    int[] sums = rowSums(arr2D);

    for (int i = 0; i < sums.length; i++) {
        for (int j = i + 1; j < sums.length; j++) {
            if (sums[i] == sums[j]) {
                return false;
            }
        }
    }

    return true;
}
```

The nested loop compares each row sum with all later row sums. If any pair is equal, the method returns `false`; otherwise, all row sums are different, so it returns `true`.

